      "writtenOn": "2025-03-18T09:29:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is not only about sending emails, but mostly about adding a change message to the source change saying that this change was reverted. Change updates use the user from the BatchUpdate as the author. AFAIK it\u0027s not possible to add a change message authored by one user from a BatchUpdate that was created for another user.",
      "parentUuid": "2c53717a_9832d01a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 86,
        "startChar": 81,
        "endLine": 88,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "12ce39477a7aa3418cbd59f4999f9611f8e035f4",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
