      "message": "\u003e it\u0027s not possible to add a change message authored by one user from a BatchUpdate that was created for another user.\n\n\\*Sigh\\* This seems like a bad pattern as it forces significant logic changes away from responsible interfaces (ie. bad incapsulation). But I am guessing it\u0027s too much of a refactor to fix. Resolving",
